what I'm going to do today is enter an
accession for an archaeal genomic

00:03:11.819 --> 00:03:12.989
sequence.

00:03:12.989 --> 00:03:19.500
there's that refseq accession  [NZ_LT158599]. this
sequence is actually close to three

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:24.209
million nucleotides long. i could put in
some coordinates here and from and to

00:03:24.209 --> 00:03:29.790
