options here i'm going to go ahead and

00:03:34.859 --> 00:03:40.470
select a slightly larger minimal orf
length just to clean up my results a bit.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:43.380
you may or may not want to do that
depending on your goals and your

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:44.519
