a feeling that your sequence may not

00:04:05.459 --> 00:04:09.239
begin at the at the beginning of the
open reading frame.

00:04:09.239 --> 00:04:14.940
so if you choose any sense codon you'll
be able to perhaps walk upstream to a

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.010
different initiation codon.

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:21.690
ok, I'm going to go ahead and check
ignore nested ORFs, again primarily just

